        "text_LjwpDq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The importance of coffee shops within local communities has grown incredibly within the last few years - who doesn’t like a great coffee or matcha? At Seventh we’re constantly searching for moments, places and spaces to rest and we found a great example in Huddle Coffee Paris.<br/>Cozily tucked in with 3rd, Huddle Coffee is a balanced warm & modern destination offering specialty coffee and a safe space for anyone to come and pitstop, work or connect. Founded by Mat & Orane, the tight-knitted team of 3 have built an inclusive community known to many Parisians. They welcomed our team into their space to talk comfort meals and the importance of community.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
