    "rich_text_UpJPxd": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_gyT8nb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What’s your ultimate comfort meal with an accompanying drink?<br/><br/></strong>Mat: The Couscous of my Algerian Grandmother<br/>Orane: The traditional ‘Pasta Rossa’ I eat with my family in Italy. Sometimes with a local red wine.<br/>Jako: Chilli Con Carne of my Mother.<br/><br/><strong>Why food & beverage over anything else?<br/><br/></strong>It’s all about conviviality, sharing and pleasure. Food is life. It brings everyone together.<br/><br/><strong>What do you enjoy the most about your work?<br/><br/></strong>Gathering people around and making connections.<br/><br/><strong>If you were to recommend anything from your menu what would it be?<br/><br/></strong>Our V60. It's a hand dripped method. You can make them with a lot of different coffee beans. You will have to make a very specific recipe in order to provide the best cup to your customer.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
